  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.2.1:\n\n## Changed\n- Updated the embedded standard PDF fonts. (DOC-7988)\n- Updated the Japanese translations of messages. (DOC-7978)\n- The SBOM included in the package is now more complete and accurate. (DOC-7982, DOC-7984, DOC-8043, DOC-8098, DOC-8101)\n- Updated third-party license notices. (DOC-7983, DOC-8044)\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where a PDF document that was loaded, modified and saved kept its original PDF version even when the added content required a later one, which caused errors in Acrobat. (DOC-7930)",
